# MQL5 EA Standards

## Structure

- Split modules: ImpulseDetector, DirectionFilter, EntryEngine, BasketManager, BulkCloseManager, RiskGovernor, MoneyManager
- Avoid one giant `OnTick` blob
- Magic number isolates this EA’s trades only

## Money management (required)

```mql5
// ❌ BAD — video-style spam on tiny account
double lot = 1.0;

// ✅ GOOD — capital-aware
double lot = MoneyManagerNormalizeLot(RiskPercentOfEquity(InpRiskPercent));
if(lot < SymbolInfoDouble(_Symbol, SYMBOL_VOLUME_MIN))
  lot = SymbolInfoDouble(_Symbol, SYMBOL_VOLUME_MIN);
```

- Read `SYMBOL_VOLUME_MIN/STEP/MAX` from broker (Deriv)
- Block new entries if margin level / free margin unsafe
- Cap `MaxLayers` from inputs; default low for $10

## Trade safety

- Spread gate before every entry
- Same-side basket only (no hedge by default)
- Bulk close all magic+symbol positions on profit/loss/time-stop
- Log entry reason + close reason

## Symbols

- Never hardcode only gold; use `_Symbol` + inputs validated in `OnInit`
- Document Deriv aliases: gold + Wall Street 30 / US30
